<h2>The First Run and How It Works</h2>
<p>Let us actually run it once. The example is a situation where a client request (CR) is reflected into the <strong>ERP sales/order module</strong>. There is exactly one key point — <strong>you give an "intent", not a "command"</strong>.</p>

<div class="note">
    <span class="nh">Today's example (CR)</span>
    Client request: <strong>"Automatically put orders that exceed the credit limit for the account's credit grade on hold, and send a notification to the sales rep."</strong> Because it is a customization that touches the standard package, <strong>impact analysis and regression tests</strong> are essential.
</div>

